## Stack

To be defined: the languages, frameworks, database and deploy target, the users' language, and how the project fills
its slots: `.github/actions/toolchain`, the justfile's `lint`, `test` and `audit`{% if release_workflow %}, `scripts/build-image.sh`,
`.github/actions/target-setup`, `scripts/deploy.sh` and, if it migrates a database, `scripts/migrate.sh`{% endif %}. Agents read
